  "body": "### What is the issue with the Compatibility Standard?\n\nSee https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12858\n\nThis keyword is \"de-facto required for web compatibility\".\n\nBlink successfully aliased it to the standard `stretch`.\n\nEven if Gecko and WebKit haven't shipped `stretch` yet, it would be good to spec `-webkit-fill-available` as an alias of `stretch`.",
